msgstr "`replace(event_type, old, new)`"

#: ../../../components/callbacks.md
msgid "Replaces a registered handler with a different one"
msgstr "登録済みハンドラを別のハンドラに差し替える"

#: ../../../components/callbacks.md:17
msgid ""
"The `Event` base class only carries `ctx` (`OptimizationState`). By "
"convention, `ctx` is treated as read-only; value changes are made via a "
"component's lifecycle hooks (such as `with_post`)."
msgstr "`Event`基底クラスは`ctx`（`OptimizationState`）だけを持ちます。 慣例として`ctx`は読み取り専用として扱い、値の変更はコンポーネントのライフサイクルフック（`with_post`など）で行います。"

